    title:'AI Advisory vs Custom Development vs FDE | Onyx Devs Lab',description:'A decision guide for choosing AI advisory, custom development, or Forward Deployed Engineering based on problem clarity, evidence, and delivery ownership.',eyebrow:'AI delivery decision guide',h1:'AI advisory, custom development, or FDE?',
